{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3000_place", "source_sha256": "d4791fb11477fe30ba4df1a8faada2b28b2b8855f65e1a06166ed650c671fc94", "ja": "公園", "zh": "公园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3001_022ser", "source_sha256": "f2b7bbf1768dba85f2fd34d7f95981dde2e7e25bd0b9e314b7eeab8c19b7c0bd", "ja": "今日のお仕事は、ジュニオールも一緒なんです！\nえへへ、ふたりで頑張りますね♪", "zh": "今天的工作，朱尼奥尔也会一起参加！\n嘿嘿，两个人一起加油喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3002_junior", "source_sha256": "d59890c5ed4a61d0afcb5d2ab11f9c74fa28702e24d65dc8bb4c105190f703f8", "ja": "わん！", "zh": "汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3003_p", "source_sha256": "d68d830ffedb0b0822369a2de3b2c1c04e31b2a029ea757703fa0e60a6fbfeaa", "ja": "おお……星梨花とジュニオールは、息がぴったりだな。\nまるで、言葉が通じ合っているみたいだ。", "zh": "哦哦……星梨花和朱尼奥尔的默契真好。\n简直就像能沟通一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3004_022ser", "source_sha256": "d385397c4a18fb7d6d963c1614af328d2c4ff671a9ba2cf6d45c9d30637ec48c", "ja": "みたいじゃないですよ、{$P$}さん。\nジュニオールは、わたしの言うことがわかるんです！", "zh": "并不是像喔，{$P$}先生。\n朱尼奥尔听得懂我说的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3005_p", "source_sha256": "389ff41dda9b8ca7b8ce6113c3dd846399c5f6f999d4259b9d5d1616207e639d", "ja": "そうなのか。ジュニオールはすごいんだな！", "zh": "这样啊，朱尼奥尔真厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3006_junior", "source_sha256": "05ac0de5dadd600b55c080ec8f9f05705280bb0cabf1aaa3b952b3c912e1cd2a", "ja": "わんわん！", "zh": "汪汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3007_022ser", "source_sha256": "efdbd0af94392b31e428a842788f21a157dbcd8929813223ccd6165f7fff2a25", "ja": "あっ。ジュニオールが、{$P$}さんと\n遊びたいって言ってますよ！", "zh": "啊，朱尼奥尔说想和{$P$}先生\n一起玩喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3008_p", "source_sha256": "8194d6ff5efe520b326c1c2098ff89283fcb4b7f28705146743961a12d065f32", "ja": "そうか。よし、それじゃ……。", "zh": "是喔，好，那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3009", "source_sha256": "7c0d96b75ae0f439dc9bd3ee07fb0d9be7f6b73644aff8d520fb2b5ac6f49691", "ja": "ボールで遊ぶ", "zh": "玩球", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3010", "source_sha256": "4269b92dc34681aea09353386c891b9a8ee33639addca57386d6c5d55a24e15d", "ja": "ロープで引っぱりっこ", "zh": "比赛拔河", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3200_p", "source_sha256": "55b34492ea87af98489e194da71e6e5ae5c9c7b82a6bea71bc6db598793e146f", "ja": "ジュニオール、ボールで遊ぼう。それっ！", "zh": "朱尼奥尔来玩球吧，去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3201_junior", "source_sha256": "05ac0de5dadd600b55c080ec8f9f05705280bb0cabf1aaa3b952b3c912e1cd2a", "ja": "わんわん！", "zh": "汪汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3202_022ser", "source_sha256": "6f8a224ffc165b1ef7dd9e59c4a08b5fbafca1acf736ee49ee610b3f85eaaf27", "ja": "わあ、ボールをあんなに遠くに投げられるなんて！\n{$P$}さん、すごいですね！", "zh": "哇啊，居然可以把球投得这么远！\n{$P$}先生真厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3203_022ser", "source_sha256": "28de603aabe23025cd25df973fd47fe3cac68dce475448824632a9976096bc72", "ja": "ジュニオール、{$P$}さんに\n遊んでもらえてよかったね♪", "zh": "朱尼奥尔，能和{$P$}先生\n一起玩真是太好了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3204_p", "source_sha256": "d1b1485f7884cee8e836ef6aa08e92237312f2b62cb589d109a570364bd5a02b", "ja": "（ボール遊びで、ジュニオールのテンションは急上昇！\nその後の撮影も大成功だった……よかったな！）", "zh": "（一起玩球让朱尼奥尔心情大好！\n之后的拍摄也非常成功……真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3300_p", "source_sha256": "387b733d30afb94a9cc9f5cb3d80eea4d5a938810872dc10d8e9d40858338bb0", "ja": "ジュニオール、ボールで遊ぼう。それ！", "zh": "朱尼奥尔来玩球吧，去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3301_junior", "source_sha256": "9f81866f9f2ef2888908f7373ccb64342b86b0010e216479d6bb3fe9fad86efb", "ja": "わうん……？", "zh": "汪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3302_022ser", "source_sha256": "c7a94adf73143fffa09e6fd544108c0e59e81ade9c94aa31fad8e9c14d2888d7", "ja": "あっ、ボールがちょっとしか飛びませんでした……。\nジュニオールは、遠くに投げないと喜ばないんです。", "zh": "啊，球只飞了一下下……\n球投得不远，朱尼奥尔会不开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3303_022ser", "source_sha256": "f0433f6dded055c8ff3bc35cb0ef330a446e2ac29aa9b7c9fdf289833e294130", "ja": "ジュニオール、次はきっと大丈夫だから……\nえっ、ボール遊びはもういい？　そう……。", "zh": "朱尼奥尔，下次一定没问题的……\n咦，已经不想玩球了？是喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3304_p", "source_sha256": "518224f58759d45c045fd2290e77d7086a245995e3bed770622aa9c105eb3110", "ja": "（ジュニオールのテンションは低いままで、撮影は\n難航した。くっ、投球練習が足りなかったか……）", "zh": "（朱尼奥尔的情绪一直很低落，导致拍摄\n困难重重。呜，我投球练习得不够啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3500_p", "source_sha256": "f9e426f2c003c580a85bea9efde283b174f0d7e68689b946a859b7049014e2d1", "ja": "ジュニオール、ロープで引っぱりっこしないか？\nほら、こっちをくわえて……。", "zh": "朱尼奥尔，要不要比赛拔河？\n来，你咬住这边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3501_junior", "source_sha256": "d59890c5ed4a61d0afcb5d2ab11f9c74fa28702e24d65dc8bb4c105190f703f8", "ja": "わん！", "zh": "汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3502_022ser", "source_sha256": "8e811c87d039bf87a467680c9996e560106b85853689e23ebecb14b55618ac6a", "ja": "わぁ、ジュニオール上手だね♪\n{$P$}さん、がんばってください！", "zh": "哇啊，朱尼奥尔做得很好呢♪\n{$P$}，请你加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3503_022ser", "source_sha256": "c9e5c231bcc1838d9ab0ac3c956983e08b64aaf07003f9e92e50ce2abee012b8", "ja": "ジュニオールは力持ちなので、わたしじゃ、上手に\n引っぱりっこできなくて。よかったね、ジュニオール！", "zh": "朱尼奥尔是个大力士，像我就没办法\n好好跟牠玩拔河。太好了呢，朱尼奥尔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3504_p", "source_sha256": "c6b83ffb7a3d691368b410a2618a4ebd7cf77ee4fc5ef4754cbdb15369dccea7", "ja": "（よほど楽しかったのか、その後すっかりジュニオール\nに懐かれ、仕事も順調だった。うまくいったな！）", "zh": "（看来朱尼奥尔玩得挺开心的，之后牠变得很亲近我，\n工作也很顺利，看来做得很不错啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3600_p", "source_sha256": "f9e426f2c003c580a85bea9efde283b174f0d7e68689b946a859b7049014e2d1", "ja": "ジュニオール、ロープで引っぱりっこしないか？\nほら、こっちをくわえて……。", "zh": "朱尼奥尔，要不要比赛拔河？\n来，你咬住这边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3601_junior", "source_sha256": "fd6fdabfcf671cd740db98d7946ddc214138787fb27a2a01f801a0939f2eb4f0", "ja": "わんわんわんわんわん！", "zh": "汪汪汪汪汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3602_p", "source_sha256": "ea1148b152bdeebb31d15fc3f01bf6a3c798e1ccf75e3021a883614848bda3b2", "ja": "うわあ！", "zh": "唔哇啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3603_022ser", "source_sha256": "065d1aa9370be4bb4fd5ec93ca13e57c1c16591c0dd656997331f2beb3787797", "ja": "あっ、ジュニオール！　そんなに強く引っぱったら\n危ない……だめ、ステイ！", "zh": "啊，朱尼奥尔！你拉这么大力会很危险……\n不行，停下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3604_022ser", "source_sha256": "bf20dbbe2970596ba99431f773c38589b1b00f3f6677882954a95b5c0e702208", "ja": "ごめんなさい、{$P$}さん。\nジュニオール、よろこびすぎちゃったみたいです……。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生。\n朱尼奥尔好像太开心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_3605_p", "source_sha256": "d02b329e231326a8abaa4cb8c26fc488e2908f262b8cdbe97e7de586983744d9", "ja": "（その後もジュニオールは俺を気にして落ち着かず、\n撮影は難航した。……なぜ、そんなに……）", "zh": "（朱尼奥尔在那之后也因为一直注意我而静不下来，\n导致拍摄困难重重……为何，会变成这样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
